    <!-- SECTION 2: FATHER'S WRITEUP & LETTER IMAGE -->
    <section class="section message-section" id="message">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-tag light-tag">
          <span class="tag-num">02</span>
          <span class="tag-line"></span>
          <span class="tag-text">INSTITUTIONAL MESSAGE</span>
        </div>

        <div class="message-layout">
          <!-- Father's Writeup Letter / Crest Image -->
          <div class="letter-visual-wrap">
            <div class="letter-card">
              <div class="letter-badge">OFFICIAL SXC COMMUNIQUE</div>
              <picture>
                <source srcset="/father.webp" type="image/webp" />
                <img src="/father.jpg" alt="Official Father Writeup & St. Xavier's College Emblem" class="letter-image" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" />
              </picture>
              <div class="letter-caption">
                <span class="caption-name">St. Xavier's College (Autonomous), Kolkata</span>
                <span class="caption-sub">Office of the Principal &bull; Nihil Ultra</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Letter Text Content -->
          <div class="message-text-wrap">
            <div class="quote-symbol" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</div>
            <span class="eyebrow-accent">MESSAGE FROM THE FATHER</span>
            <h2 class="father-heading">Run with Purpose. <em>Run for Our Earth.</em></h2>
            <p class="father-title">Rev. Fr. Dominic Savio, S.J.</p>
            <p class="father-designation">Principal, St. Xavier's College (Autonomous), Kolkata</p>

            <blockquote class="father-letter-body">
              <p>
                At St. Xavier's College, education has always transcended textbook pedagogy. We are called to nurture the mind, fortify the body, and kindle the moral consciousness of every human being. <strong>XAVATHON</strong> emerges from this profound conviction &mdash; an arena where youth vigor, sportsmanship, and ecological stewardship unite in purpose.
              </p>
              <p>
                As we inaugurate our 2nd Edition themed <strong>&ldquo;Towards Greener Footprints&rdquo;</strong>, we invite our dear students, esteemed alumni, faculty members, and the wider citizenry of Kolkata to step forward. Each step taken is not merely an athletic pursuit, but a conscious pledge for environmental rejuvenation and climate responsibility.
              </p>
              <p>
                Let us run with joy, integrity, and relentless determination, true to the timeless Xaverian ideal &mdash; <em>Nihil Ultra</em> (Nothing Beyond).
              </p>
            </blockquote>

            <div class="signature-block">
              <div class="sig-line"></div>
              <div class="sig-details">
                <strong>Rev. Fr. Dominic Savio, S.J.</strong>
                <span>Principal &bull; St. Xavier's College, Kolkata</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 10: GALLERY — 56 CURATED MOMENTS ACROSS 7 STREAMS & INSTAGRAM INTEGRATION -->
    <section class="section gallery-section" id="gallery" style="padding-top: 3.5rem;">
