              <h3 class="faq-section-title">Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h3>
              <p class="faq-section-subtitle">
                Everything you need to know about Xavathon 2027: race categories, eco-initiatives, official runner kits, route guidelines, and college facilities.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-quick-stats">
              <div class="f-stat"><span class="fs-num">3</span><span class="fs-label">Races</span></div>
              <div class="f-stat"><span class="fs-num">0%</span><span class="fs-label">Single-Use Plastic</span></div>
