          </div>
          <p class="footer-about-text">
            St. Xavier's College Kolkata's premier annual marathon advocating for active health and environmental sustainability under the banner <em>&ldquo;Towards Greener Footprints&rdquo;</em>.
          </p>
          <div class="footer-motto">
            <span>COLLEGE MOTTO:</span> <strong>NIHIL ULTRA (NOTHING BEYOND)</strong>
